      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Erath%2C_Louisiana"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "Founded in 1899, Erath sits between Abbeville and Delcambre along Louisiana Highway 14.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://mostcajun.com/towns/erath/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Acadian Museum in Erath showcases the history of Acadians who settled after being expelled from Nova Scotia.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
